{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:40:39Z","created_by_operation":"op_bd05abd910b94a1daac291222a892953","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8a0096434ea9902cf184244dc53bbf0f4ca0357bb2109aee4f0ea8295c34a1e6","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"catatafishen/agentbridge@124f7c082dc3 snapshot b1b11b5b76643edd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_693a66703121d26f7239d9a88502d69f8000a7052447e9403f3aac52c2d129b8","slc_93b96a8cfd4027491452e61fe94f49c1b60e4e496f5e4bfbe5c10f7427d972ef","slc_bbc7ae7a30bba9f62be0fb4c265b90c494aee02b57cfd1f0caef80e7c1f908da"],"source_ids":["src_2c1a93c3237959a99d58abdbf4a9cf2c"],"text":"A prolonged EDT freeze (30+ seconds) can permanently stall the JCEF off-screen renderer; defenses include an EdtFreezeRecovery heartbeat monitor and a 2-second cooldown on file-open navigations to prevent cascading VCS git log/blame operations.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:40:39Z","updated_by_operation":"op_bd05abd910b94a1daac291222a892953"}
